    <briefdescription>
<para>A parser for the __llvm_faultmaps section generated by the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_fault_maps" kindref="compound">FaultMaps</ref> class declared in <ref refid="_fault_maps_8h" kindref="compound">llvm/CodeGen/FaultMaps.h</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This parser is version locked with with the __llvm_faultmaps section generated by the version of LLVM that includes it. No guarantees are made with respect to forward or backward compatibility. </para>
